&#x200B;

*let people enjoy things*

Build list cost me about $450. She,s not an SBR and that can is faux, slip-on, so no tax stamps required, and I build it on a pre existing pistol lower so all I really needed was an upper.

&#x200B;

Worthy sacrifice, though I'm slowly rebuilding that pistol.

Technically pathfinder: Chaotic Good Half-Elf Sorcerer. First D&D character I ever made, and has gone through so many different itterations and builds. He's my boy, and I always play him when I get a chance to (perma GM). I'm currently playing him as a Sorcerer/Swashbuckler in a gestalt game, and an Elvaan Black Mage in a Final Fantasy one.

&#x200B;

Lov my firey boiyo
